==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Special Clearance}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*6 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 25.33 seconds<sup>760f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 73.33~76.67 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Instead of being a stage that dies to [[Dark Lazer]], this is a stage that dies to [[Esoteric Uril]] and/or [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]]. Try to play aggressively at all times and to get an early Shield Pierce onto Le'Behemoth.

===Recommended Units===
*[[Cat Cactus]]: While Maize may target Relics, Cactus is Surge Immune and also benefits from being a Special Unit.
*Anti-Aku Freezers: Either [[Exorcist Cat]] or a Talented [[Li'l Dark Cat]] will work here. Once you Pierce Le'Behemoth's Shield, you can spam a huge amount of these units and stunlock Le'Behemoth, making this stage much faster.
*[[Ultimate Mecha-Bun]]: Even unboosted, Mecha-Bun makes a grand return from the back of your collection as an anti-Relic rusher. His stats benefit from Strong Up CatCombos that you might be using to assist your Uril and Cactus, and being a Special unit he benefits from the Colosseum's modifier.

